{
  "id": "6a6bf592c8f94b1427b7e2a7",
  "title": "麻雀牌を見る時に目が滑る",
  "created": 1785460127,
  "updated": 1785544978,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a6bf592c8f94b1427b7e2a7",
      "text": "麻雀牌を見る時に目が滑る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460127,
      "updated": 1785460127
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf67e00000000006e1213",
      "text": "[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460350,
      "updated": 1785460351
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf5df00000000006e120a",
      "text": "麻雀のルール説明を読んでいる時に牌を認識しようとすると目が滑る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460191,
      "updated": 1785460255
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf62400000000006e120b",
      "text": "\t数字と紐づかない",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460260,
      "updated": 1785460265
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf59e00000000006e1207",
      "text": "ついでに用語でも目が滑る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460127,
      "updated": 1785460203
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf5b400000000006e1208",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460148,
      "updated": 1785460148
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf63000000000006e120c",
      "text": "なので、自分でまとめることで覚えを良くしていこう",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460272,
      "updated": 1785460320
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf63000000000006e120d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460272,
      "updated": 1785460272
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf66100000000006e120e",
      "text": "適当にこのサイトを見る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460322,
      "updated": 1785460346
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf67900000000006e1210",
      "text": "\thttps://mj-king.net/rule/rule/1_02.html",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460346,
      "updated": 1785460346
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf67b00000000006e1211",
      "text": "\t数牌：1-9までの数字が描かれたタイプの牌が3種",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460348,
      "updated": 1785460544
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf71d00000000006e1219",
      "text": " \t> [https://gyazo.com/54d04f32cf832fdf88a0b95ddcfcfc8d]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460509,
      "updated": 1785460533
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf87100000000006e1255",
      "text": " \t\t数牌の名前は[$ \\footnotesize(イー,リャン,サン,スー,ウー,ロン,チー,パー,キュー)\\times(マン,ソー,ピン)]の組み合わせになっている。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460849,
      "updated": 1785460982
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf8bd00000000006e1256",
      "text": " \t\t\tリャンは両の中国語読みだろうか。アルだと思っている場合は注意",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460926,
      "updated": 1785461049
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c6be400000000000f73e3",
      "text": " \t\t\t アルが「に」で両(リャン)が「ふたつ」のかんじ[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1785490405,
      "updated": 1785490457
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bfa1600000000006e1259",
      "text": " \t\t\t九の中国語読みは jiu でジューに近い。日本でプレイする場合キューの方が通じる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785461271,
      "updated": 1785461347
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c66cb00000000001ee055",
      "text": " \t\t\t6はロー?[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1785489098,
      "updated": 1785489115
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d40f80000000000e72f0e",
      "text": "  \t\t\tliù とか lu とか出てきたから「リウ」「ルー」の方が近そう[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785544953,
      "updated": 1785544978
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf76b00000000006e121b",
      "text": " \t\t画像の中でカタカナになってる牌の名前の漢字表記",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460588,
      "updated": 1785460611
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf78300000000006e121d",
      "text": "  \t\t萬子：一萬・二萬・三萬・四萬・五萬・六萬・七萬・八萬・九萬",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460611,
      "updated": 1785460732
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf81d00000000006e1240",
      "text": "    索子：一索・二索・三索・四索・五索・六索・七索・八索・九索",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460766,
      "updated": 1785460818
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf83b00000000006e1254",
      "text": "  \t\t筒子：一筒・二筒・三筒・四筒・五筒・六筒・七筒・八筒・九筒",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460795,
      "updated": 1785460797
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf7de00000000006e123e",
      "text": " \t萬子：漢字",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460702,
      "updated": 1785460704
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf6b100000000006e1215",
      "text": " \t索子：緑、竹（ほとんど竹だが1は孔雀が描かれているため、大雑把に認識するなら緑がいい）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460402,
      "updated": 1785461074
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf6b500000000006e1216",
      "text": " \t筒子：玉・団子",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460406,
      "updated": 1785460532
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf71400000000006e1218",
      "text": "\t字牌：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460501,
      "updated": 1785460523
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf96b00000000006e1257",
      "text": " \t> [https://gyazo.com/743da12c62fb723ff9b0dd14ca332a0d]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785461099,
      "updated": 1785461110
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf97100000000006e1258",
      "text": "\t\tハクは白の中国語読み",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785461105,
      "updated": 1785461244
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bf67b00000000006e1212",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785460348,
      "updated": 1785460348
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bfcd100000000006e1261",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785461969,
      "updated": 1785461969
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c00d400000000006e1275",
      "text": "面子（メンツ）：目指す形",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462996,
      "updated": 1785462997
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c00d500000000006e1277",
      "text": "\t補足：暗刻・暗槓については後述",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462997,
      "updated": 1785463134
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c00d400000000006e1276",
      "text": " 刻子（コーツ）：同じ牌3つ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462996,
      "updated": 1785467292
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c00e200000000006e127a",
      "text": "  > [https://gyazo.com/cd9e649c1e23b9a0eb91d10bfe728494]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463010,
      "updated": 1785463013
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c00e100000000006e1278",
      "text": "\t槓子（カンツ）：同じ牌4つ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463010,
      "updated": 1785463023
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c00ee00000000006e127d",
      "text": "\t\t> [https://gyazo.com/9f1de8b8a11ae64aa90f1ede2eb61d4e]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463023,
      "updated": 1785463034
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c00ee00000000006e127c",
      "text": "\t順子（シュンツ）：同一柄で数字が連続しているもの",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463022,
      "updated": 1785463048
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c010700000000006e127e",
      "text": "\t\t> [https://gyazo.com/99850ddf9c9637600858fbc5deba10ef]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463048,
      "updated": 1785463048
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bfdc000000000006e1268",
      "text": "\t惜しい形",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462209,
      "updated": 1785463159
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c00b900000000006e1274",
      "text": "\t\t対子（トイツ）：同じ牌2つ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462969,
      "updated": 1785467267
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bff7e00000000006e1270",
      "text": "\t\t塔子（ターツ）：順子（数字3連）にあと一歩でなる状態",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462655,
      "updated": 1785462768
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bfff000000000006e1271",
      "text": "\t\t\t> [https://gyazo.com/7ede9401511c6306cfe90fea99c11a5b]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462768,
      "updated": 1785462851
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6bfff400000000006e1272",
      "text": "\t\t\t\t画像は二索・三索、五萬・六萬、八筒・九筒",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462773,
      "updated": 1785462877
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c009800000000006e1273",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785462937,
      "updated": 1785462937
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c017c00000000006e1280",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463165,
      "updated": 1785463165
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c0dec00000000009a2056",
      "text": "麻雀の流れ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785466349,
      "updated": 1785466353
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c0df100000000009a2058",
      "text": "\t左回り順に各自が要らない牌を捨てていく",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785466353,
      "updated": 1785467007
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c108900000000009a205b",
      "text": "\tプレイヤーは他プレイヤーが捨てた牌（捨牌）を拾うことができる。その際に拾う理由を宣言しなければならない。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785467018,
      "updated": 1785467251
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c112f00000000009a205e",
      "text": "\t\tポン：手牌に[< トイツ]対子があり、捨牌を拾うことで[< コーツ]刻子になる場合に宣言する",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785467183,
      "updated": 1785467363
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c11e300000000009a205f",
      "text": "\t\t\tつまり、手牌に同じ牌が2つあり、捨牌を拾うことで同じ牌が3つになる場合にポンと宣言して捨牌を拾える。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785467363,
      "updated": 1785467439
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c122f00000000009a2060",
      "text": "\t\t\t揃った分は右端に置いて公開しなければならない。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785467440,
      "updated": 1785467488
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c125f00000000009a2061",
      "text": "\t\tチー：手牌",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785467488,
      "updated": 1785467574
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c0dec00000000009a2057",
      "text": "\tちょっと筆を置いて休憩……",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785466349,
      "updated": 1785467645
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c0e3300000000009a2059",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785466420,
      "updated": 1785466420
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c017f00000000006e1283",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463167,
      "updated": 1785463167
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c017f00000000006e1284",
      "text": "面子（メンツ）再び",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463168,
      "updated": 1785463176
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e1286",
      "text": " 刻子：同じ牌3つ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e1287",
      "text": "  暗刻（アンコ）：同じ牌3つを作る際にポンをしなかったもの",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e1288",
      "text": "   > [https://gyazo.com/cd9e649c1e23b9a0eb91d10bfe728494]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e1289",
      "text": "  明刻（ミンコ）：同じ牌3つを作る際にポンをしたもの",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e128a",
      "text": "  \t[https://gyazo.com/57398a3f5b798881cededfe26725c588]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e128b",
      "text": " 槓子（カンツ）：同じ牌4つ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e128c",
      "text": " \t暗槓（アンカン）：同じ牌4つを作る際にカンをしなかったもの",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e128d",
      "text": " \t\t[https://gyazo.com/9f1de8b8a11ae64aa90f1ede2eb61d4e]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e128e",
      "text": " \t明槓（ミンカン）：同じ牌4つを作る際にカンをしたもの",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e128f",
      "text": " \t\t[https://gyazo.com/55db25f518b850f92647478f8c0d3311]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c018800000000006e1290",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785463176,
      "updated": 1785463185
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c017e00000000006e1282",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
